+                                        invokes the subagent, receives a natural language description of its output, and reasons over that
+                                        description to decide subsequent actions(Tran et al., 2025). Verbal collaboration is natural when both
+                                        agents are language models as they share a vocabulary and can express their state in words. However,
+                                        in many important domains such as game playing, robotics, and autonomous driving the strongest
